MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD=PASSWORD=)
VITE_AUTH0_DOMAIN: the tenant domain, e.g. your-tenant.eu.auth0.com, with no https://
VITE_AUTH0_CLIENT_ID: from your Auth0 Single Page Application
VITE_AUTH0_AUDIENCE: the API identifier, which must match Auth0:Audience in the backend
VITE_API_URL: already http://localhost:5101 in the template; check it matches the port in launchSettings.json
